{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOS","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"約書亞記","commonName":"約書亞記","title":"約書亞記","order":6,"numberOfChapters":24,"sha256":"f7e1b1e3a4dc3046bef5e950d8950a0c7949bc630099873ff7e5975154253ce8","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":24,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JOS/24.json","totalNumberOfVerses":656},"chapter":{"number":20,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["設立庇護城"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華曉諭約書亞說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「你吩咐以色列人說：你們要照着我藉摩西所曉諭你們的，為自己設立逃城，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["使那無心而誤殺人的，可以逃到那裏。這些城可以作你們逃避報血仇人的地方。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["那殺人的要逃到這些城中的一座城，站在城門口，將他的事情說給城內的長老們聽。他們就把他收進城裏，給他地方，使他住在他們中間。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["若是報血仇的追了他來，長老不可將他交在報血仇的手裏；因為他是素無仇恨，無心殺了人的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他要住在那城裏，站在會眾面前聽審判，等到那時的大祭司死了，殺人的才可以回到本城本家，就是他所逃出來的那城。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["於是，以色列人在拿弗他利山地分定加利利的基低斯；在以法蓮山地分定示劍；在猶大山地分定基列‧亞巴（基列‧亞巴就是希伯崙）；"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["又在約旦河外耶利哥東，從呂便支派中，在曠野的平原，設立比悉；從迦得支派中設立基列的拉末；從瑪拿西支派中設立巴珊的哥蘭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["這都是為以色列眾人和在他們中間寄居的外人所分定的城邑，使誤殺人的都可以逃到那裏，不死在報血仇人的手中，等他站在會眾面前聽審判。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JOS/20.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JOS/21.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JOS/19.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}